 "caveats": [
  "Pfam-only input (MaizeGDB precomputed) lacks RPW8 (PF05659) and CC_RX (PF18052) coverage, so CNL/RNL subclassing is only reliable on the uniform re-scan; on Pfam-only data those genes fall to NL/N_only.",
  "TM/signal-peptide evidence requires Phobius/SignalP/TMHMM in the InterProScan run; where absent, RLK_other and RLP calls are made on domain architecture alone and are flagged lower-confidence.",
  "NLR counts from ab initio Helixer models can differ substantially from curated models: NLR clusters are repetitive and tandemly arrayed, a known hard case for gene callers. Report both arms, never one alone."
 ]
